<title>USA: Indonesia Telkom at 27-7/8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Indonesia Telkom at 27-7/8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Telekomunikasi Indonesia (Telkom) closed at 27-7/8 in New York on Monday. It recorded the day's low of 27-7/8 and the day's high of 28-1/4.</p>
<p>Volume was 20,100 American Depository Shares. Block volume was nil.</p>
<p>It previous close on Thursday was 28-1/2. One ADS represents 20 ordinary shares. -- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
